1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,815
Central Doha. February 2010.

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:11,505
31 hectares, beside Souq Waqif.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,751
Construction began here in January 2010.

4
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:23,116
By 2013, the old quarter is gone.

5
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,495
One excavation fills the site.

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:32,115
October 2015. Four restored houses open as museums.

7
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:38,312
May 2019. The metro opens beneath it.

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,054
Ten years. A new district, on the same ground.

9
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:50,145
Msheireb, Doha.
